  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bf2d7532251303545ab78ab68b00d5cf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 17F02_TerminalSignoffIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sequenceId: 17F02_TerminalSignoffIntro
  notes: '17F02 terminal recommendation; ready for terminal choice binding. Source:
    HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_Expanded_Native_English_Lobby_Mia_Commentary.md, Scene
    2.6. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync All Dialogue From Final
    Script.'
  lines:
  - startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Inspector, this household's stability index has fallen below the warning
      threshold. Based on the fourteen-day pattern and tonight's escalation, the
      seventy-two-hour projection is a prolonged standoff. Without outside support,
      separation becomes likely within two weeks.
    holdSeconds: 12
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Keeping the unit active significantly reduces that risk. The partner-repair
      module has been used in one thousand two hundred eighty-three comparable cases.
      Ninety-seven point four percent returned to the safe range.
    holdSeconds: 12
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: 'Standard disposition is A: restart the unit remotely. The repair module
      will activate automatically and mediate according to company protocol. The
      household is expected to return to the safe range quickly.'
    holdSeconds: 12
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Option B is an observation period. The unit remains off, and Ben and Claire
      handle the next several days without system support.
    holdSeconds: 9.451886
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Your disposition, Inspector.
    holdSeconds: 2.2820754
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
